        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI BEST BUY ON STAINLESS STEEL LEVER SETS</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<br> All stainless steel levers. Extremely resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for door hardware. It needs little looking after and does not degrade in appearance or function with use<br>\r\n<br>\r\nLever SIG113<br>\r\nAdjustable Door thickness 1 3/8\" to 2\"<br>\r\nFits standard door cut outs<br>\r\nAll Levers meet <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a><br>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen choosing a function:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*This Lever was discontinued 11/17/09.</b>\r\n</p>",
